        "ggn5KcBHDKv_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(29,31,37);\">Crafted from high-quality EVA material to safeguard your gear from drops, spills, unexpected weather, and everyday wear.</span></p>",
        "ggpDT2JjMb8_text": "<p>102+ Reviews</p>",
        "ggqpnCEQMQV_text": "<p>Soft inner lining and built-in mesh pocket ensure your tech stays secure and shielded from scratches.</p>",
