        "gg4TkwRjFpV_text": "<p>ThePhotoStick Travel Tech Case is perfect for keeping small tech essentials together, including ThePhotoStick devices, USB drives, earbuds, SD cards, charging cables, adapters, and other compact accessories.</p>",
